    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "\"Supportive communities: how health and welfare contexts shape neighbor relationships across 29 countries with unequal public healthcare resources\" analyzed how individual health status and financial disadvantages relate to emotional and instrumental neighbor relationships across 29 countries. \"Who supports transformative parking policies? Insights from urban population segments\" segmented urban residents into four distinct parking policy profiles using k-means clustering on survey data from 1,186 residents in two German cities. \"Socio-spatial drivers of thermal environment evolution in East African informal settlements based on multi-temporal LCZ analysis of major metropolises\" analyzed the thermal evolution of informal settlements in Kampala, Nairobi, and Dar es Salaam from 2014 to 2024 using a newly introduced Local Climate Zone subclass for compact-lightweight informal morphology.",
